GPDK "vipvs" directory contents:

cdsinitVIPVS.il

   Virtuoso .cdsinit load file for enabling VIPVS (GPDK_INSTALL_DIR must be
   set):
   load(strcat(getShellEnvVar("GPDK_INSTALL_DIR") "/vipvs/cdsinitVIPVS.il"))

   Contains common VIPVS configuration features.

createShapshot.csh

   Example script for creating Snapshots from the presets below. PVS must be 
   in the path.  For the Snapshots released in this version, PVS 16.12.000
   was used.
 
DRC_GPDK_v1p0.vipvs_preset
FEOL_GPDK_v1p0.vipvs_preset
BEOL_GPDK_v1p0.vipvs_preset
CutMx_GPDK_v1p0.vipvs_preset
ViaColorConflict_GPDK_v1p0.vipvs_preset

   Preset files for the VIPVS Toolbar.

   These originally generated from the VIPVS toolbar, then modified to be input
   to the createSnapshot.csh script above.  To generated a new file, use the 
   VIPVS toolbar settings menu.  Fill-in all the fields, and then do a
   File->Save Preset.  Use a text editor to make any changes.

Snapshots/
<preset name>.cap
<preset name>.layermap
<preset name>.objectmap
<preset name>.preset
<preset name>.snp
<preset name>.sum
<preset name>.tag
...

   Generated files required for a VIPVS Snapshot, with PVS 16.12.000.

